    "description": "Private house located in Block M7 of Dura-Europos.",
    "details": "<p><span>Mapped by the International Digital Dura-Europos Archive (IDEA). Tracing of M7 Plan by Jennifer A. Baird depicted in <em>The Inner Lives of Ancient Houses: An Archaeology of Dura-Europos</em> (Oxford University Press, 2014), 76, Fig. 2.11. (Since the houses of Block M7 share walls, section cut lines were drawn at the intersection of perpendicular walls, maintaining the width of shared walls.)</span></p>",
